onnexa non contra. Ratio est summa\n[[515.5]] requisitorum. Sensibilia perfecte intelligi non possunt a nobis, quoniam ad eorum\n[[515.6]] constitutionem concurrunt infinita, ob temporis et loci divisibilitatem in infinitum.\n[[515.7]] Unde fit ut perceptio qualitatis sensibilis non sit una perceptio sed aggregatum infinitarum.\n[[515.9]] Deus infinita, infinitis excogitat modis.\n","number":"72.","title":"De formis seu attributis Dei","date":""}
      </script>

      <!-- Detailed scholarly view with line numbers -->
      <div id="scholarly-view" class="text-view">
        <div class="scholarly-notice">
          <p><strong>📚 Scholarly View:</strong> Original text with line number annotations preserved.</p>
